    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82169" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περισσ-άρτιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>odd and even</i>: Arith.
			of numbers <i>which become uneven when divided by some power of
			two</i>, such as <i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i> (for <i><span class="en">
				24
			</span></i>&lt;*&gt;<i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>&lt;*&gt; =
			<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Nicom.
				<u>Ar.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.162
			</span></i>.</div>
